# auto-advance, 7-day ETA broadcast, detention escalations). Standard
# 5-field cron syntax.
# Only fires on deployments that keep a persistent Node process alive
# (this dev server, a VPS, Docker) -- not on serverless platforms.
# Defaults to 06:00 server time daily if unset.
